replacements, plus refurbished computer sales", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='all-about-electronics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='All European Auto Supply operates from Ferndale, Michigan, serving as a specialist distributor of genuine, OE, and OEM replacement parts for European vehicle brands including BMW, Volkswagen, Mercedes-Benz, Mini, Audi, Porsche, Land Rover, Saab, and Fiat. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed in the available sources.

The business functions as a wholesale and retail parts supplier, maintaining a warehouse operation that supports both shipping and contact-free locker pickup for local customers. Its catalog spans braking, engine timing, lighting, electrical, chassis, and filtration components sourced from established manufacturers such as Brembo, Febi Bilstein, Valeo, DENSO, and Professional Parts Sweden. The company offers a business-to-business account program with volume pricing, a bulk-deal discount on orders of ten or more line items, and a VIN-based lookup tool to ensure fitment accuracy.

All European Auto Supply emphasizes its role as an authorized distributor for key brands, highlighting its recent agreement to stock genuine Brembo braking products at wholesale prices. The company states that it differentiates itself through cross-trained warehouse staff, a low-pressure work environment, and fast shipping backed by expert support, though specific service-level metrics are not published.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wholesale distribution of European automotive replacement parts", "B2B account management with volume pricing", "E-commerce order fulfillment and shipping", "Local locker pickup", "VIN-based part lookup", "Multi-part search and bulk ordering", "Technical content curation from OEM partners"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket parts distribution", "European vehicle repair and maintenance", "Independent repair shop supply", "Fleet maintenance parts supply"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Ferndale, Michigan -> db", "Brands carried: BMW, VW, Mercedes, Mini, Audi, Porsche, Land Rover, Saab, Fiat -> /", "Authorized Brembo distributor -> /", "B2B accounts with wholesale pricing and bulk discount (min 10 items) -> /", "Warehouse operations with locker pickup -> /", "Cross-trained warehouse staff mentioned in careers post -> /", "Technical articles from Febi Bilstein and Valeo -> /", "Facebook link in footer -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "All European - Genuine, OE & OEM Parts for your BMW, VW, Mercedes, Mini, Audi, Porsche, Land Rover, Saab, Fiat", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "10 items for bulk discount", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["Facebook"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='all-european-auto-supply' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='All Metal Fabricators Inc. was founded in 1976 in Acton, Massachusetts. The company operates as a precision metal fabricator serving a range of industries from its facility on Hayward Road.

The shop provides architectural metalwork, biopharmaceutical fabrication, residential metalwork, industrial fabrication, automotive fabrication, and prototype fabrication. Equipment includes a CNC hydraulic press brake with a 10-foot bed and a Piranha iron worker with punch assembly. The company states it can create virtually any shape or design in metal.

Customers span science and industry, biopharma, industrial, automotive, architectural, and residential sectors. The firm highlights partnerships with architect professionals and a variety of industries.

