UPDATE companies SET description='All Metal Manufacturing operates from Rapid City, South Dakota, where it has served the Black Hills region since 1987. The company began in a small garage under founder Tim Burke and has grown into a family‑owned operation employing over 35 people at its current location on Universal Drive.

The shop provides a full range of metal fabrication services, including ornamental railings, metal staircases, spiral staircases, and custom iron works such as drive gates and electric gate closures. It also handles structural steel fabrication and installation — columns, beams, joists, and metal decking — along with portable welding, roof access ladders, and steel lintels. The facility is expanding to meet rising demand.

Customers include commercial and private construction projects throughout the Black Hills, with a longstanding base of local contractors who rely on the company for both fabrication and installation.

As longtime residents, the owners emphasize stewardship of the area’s natural resources, framing their commitment to quality sales, service, and installation around that responsibility.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Ornamental railings", "Handrails", "Metal staircases", "Spiral staircases", "Structural steel fabrication", "Structural steel installation", "Steel columns", "Steel beams", "Steel joists", "Metal decking", "Custom iron works", "Drive gates", "Electric gate closures", "Portable welding", "Roof access ladders", "Steel lintels"], "industries": ["Commercial construction", "Residential construction", "Contractors"], "materials": ["Steel", "Iron", "Metal"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family\u2011owned business offering integrated sales, service, and installation", "Expanding shop capacity to meet growing demand", "Decades\u2011long relationships with local contractors", "Commitment to protecting the Black Hills\u2019 natural resources"], "facts_used": ["Located in Rapid City, SD -> /", "Serving Black Hills since 1987 -> /", "Founded by Tim Burke in a small garage -> /", "Family-owned business -> /", "Over 35 employees -> /", "Expanding shop to meet demand -> /", "Services: ornamental railings, metal staircases, spiral staircases, miscellaneous fabrication -> /", "Structural steel: columns, beams, joists, metal decking -> /", "Commercial and private projects -> /", "Local contractors -> /", "Commitment to protect natural resources -> /", "Services list: structural steel fabrication and installation, ornamental railings, handrails, metal stairways, spiral stairways, custom iron works, drive gates, electric gate closures, portable welding, roof access ladders, steel lintels -> /services", "Founded year 1987 -> db", "Employee count 35 -> db", "HQ city Rapid City -> db", "HQ state South Dakota -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We do