UPDATE companies SET description='All Steel Fabricators Inc is a family-owned steel fabrication company based in West Valley City, Utah. Founded in 1974, the business has served Utah businesses for nearly five decades, building a reputation for handling a wide variety of fabrication needs both large and small.

