UPDATE companies SET description='Amerifab Corporation has operated as a custom sheet metal fabricator in Lodi, New Jersey, since 1976.

The shop provides a range of sheet metal processes including shearing and bending up to 12 feet, CNC punching, rolling, and welding (TIG, MIG, and stick). It also offers grinding, polishing, sanitary finishing, and patina finishes. Work is performed on materials such as stainless steel, aluminum, carbon steel, galvanized steel, brass, bronze, copper, and Muntz metal, in forms including sheet, plate, angle, and tubing.

Amerifab serves architectural, industrial, pharmaceutical, machinery builder, and food-industry customers. Its work appears in both industrial equipment and architectural installations, with sanitary finishing capabilities tailored to pharmaceutical and food-processing requirements.

