UPDATE companies SET description='Anderson Woodworks LLC operates from a shop in Yelm, Washington, where founder Brian Anderson builds custom furniture, cabinetry, and one-of-a-kind collector pieces. An Olympia-area native, Anderson spent roughly twelve years in custom home building before opening his own shop, applying that experience to pieces that must live in real houses. The business is structured as an LLC with Anderson as the sole craftsman; every piece passes through his hands alone.

The shop produces dining tables, desks, consoles, kitchen and bath cabinetry, library built-ins, and closet systems, all using hand-cut dovetail and mortise-and-tenon joinery rather than screws or staples. Anderson also offers a Studio Line of proven designs built to order and a Collector Line of singular works that may include marquetry inlay and experimental forms. In addition to fabrication, he provides furniture-led interior design consultations—space planning, material direction, and layout guidance—charging fees for design direction and full-room design packages. Projects begin with a free on-site estimate in Thurston and Pierce Counties, followed by a paid design phase before any wood is cut.

Clients include homeowners, collectors, and interior designers throughout the South Sound region—Olympia, Lacey, Tumwater, Tacoma, and Gig Harbor—with collector pieces shipped nationally. The service model skips catalogs and middlemen; Anderson designs, builds, and delivers each piece, while installation is coordinated with the client’s contractor.

Anderson positions the business on the premise that furniture should shape the room, not follow trends. He emphasizes traditional joinery that takes longer but yields pieces intended to last generations, and he frames his role as helping clients make clear, confident decisions so their homes feel grounded and intentional.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture making", "Cabinetry and built-ins", "Collector pieces with marquetry inlay", "Hand-cut dovetail joinery", "Mortise-and-tenon joinery", "Furniture-led interior design consultation", "Space planning and layout guidance", "Material and finish selection", "Custom furniture design", "Fabrication", "Installation guidance"], "industries": ["Residential", "Interior design", "Custom furniture", "Cabinetry", "Collector furniture"], "materials": ["Hardwoods", "Local hardwoods"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Hand-cut dovetail and mortise-and-tenon joinery on every piece", "Sole maker Brian Anderson builds and oversees each project", "Free on-site estimates throughout Thurston and Pierce Counties", "Furniture-led interior design consultation and full-room design packages", "Two product lines: Studio Line (built-to-order) and Collector Line (one-of-a-kind)"], "facts_used": ["Location: Yelm, Washington -> /", "Founder: Brian Anderson -> /", "Process: Hand-cut dovetail and mortise-and-tenon joinery -> /", "Services: Custom furniture, cabinetry, built-ins, collector pieces -> /", "Service area: South Sound (Olympia, Lacey, Tumwater, Tacoma, Gig Harbor) -> /", "Business model: Sole maker, no middlemen -> /", "Design consultation services: Furniture-led interior design -> /about-us", "Product lines: Studio Line and Collector Line -> /about-us", "Philosophy: Furniture should shape the room, not chase trends -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Custom furniture, cabinetry, and built-ins, 