": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "All of our products are proudly manufactured at our 30,000 sf facility located in Portland Oregon.", "founded_year": "1976", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='applied-plastics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Baton Rouge, Louisiana, Arcco Power Systems operates as a generator sales, service, and rental company. The firm maintains a staff of local employees supplemented by over 100 regional emergency responders who can be mobilized quickly for large-scale projects.

The company services all makes and models of generators, provides fuel cleaning and fuel management services, and maintains a 60-unit portable generator fleet for emergency rental. Technicians are on call 24 hours a day, 365 days a year for repairs, fueling, and temporary power replacement.

